{"4087830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Hollow Complex", "steam_appid": 4087830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A door that opens to places it shouldn't. Research labs, a darkened suburban street, endless tiled pools, and the yellow glow of lights no human was meant to see.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Hollow Complex</strong> is an action filled survival thriller inspired by the Backrooms. Dive into a dark and twisted rendition of internet folklore that actually allows you to fight back. Explore a web of interconnected locations, complete quests for an odd cast of NPCs, and find new equipment/tools to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PICK YOUR DESTINATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/65c39e973a0fa4d3def5b604c6a74c8e.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/65c39e973a0fa4d3def5b604c6a74c8e.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/65c39e973a0fa4d3def5b604c6a74c8e.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All doors lead home. Find new entrances to your Safe Room as you progress. Make food, take a shower, or listen to music before your next outing. You can even return to any previously visited location to collect supplies and complete requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT BACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use firearms, melee weapons, and your feet to even the odds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/17f4da2ea107adbe3235e020fdb41f3e.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/17f4da2ea107adbe3235e020fdb41f3e.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/17f4da2ea107adbe3235e020fdb41f3e.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/b83cb7886c9424c5a7b6b97b26c56ba4.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/b83cb7886c9424c5a7b6b97b26c56ba4.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/b83cb7886c9424c5a7b6b97b26c56ba4.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/ca2ff9b662db8102652d615bbf91929f.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/ca2ff9b662db8102652d615bbf91929f.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/ca2ff9b662db8102652d615bbf91929f.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DYNAMIC SURFACES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keeping<i><strong> </strong></i>yourself <strong>clean</strong> is a top priority:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/38219a9cb19b3cca85a99683af921165.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=750 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/38219a9cb19b3cca85a99683af921165.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/38219a9cb19b3cca85a99683af921165.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spray enemies and the environment with a variety of liquids in real time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/f99262d019e85a221838148280cd2817.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/f99262d019e85a221838148280cd2817.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/f99262d019e85a221838148280cd2817.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use tools on dynamic surfaces to ignite fires, shock enemies, and more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/3f84591d222741a1ff92a8edd5b8882f.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=850 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/3f84591d222741a1ff92a8edd5b8882f.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/3f84591d222741a1ff92a8edd5b8882f.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A wealth of different enemies, all with their own strengths and weaknesses:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/5fec62418957672cb03d8bb457f1e9b3.avif?t=1775566745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras_big/5fec62418957672cb03d8bb457f1e9b3.webp?t=1775566745 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/669f2b1052bfc38a8e8051a2a3f310ef.avif?t=1775566745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras_big/669f2b1052bfc38a8e8051a2a3f310ef.webp?t=1775566745 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/8e3e06a47692257882ea41e1a5671d1c.avif?t=1775566745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras_big/8e3e06a47692257882ea41e1a5671d1c.webp?t=1775566745 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/337bfe4f36c96d30fa00370174ef1bd0.avif?t=1775566745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras_big/337bfe4f36c96d30fa00370174ef1bd0.webp?t=1775566745 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(and many more!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">TAKE A BREAK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Brew coffee and microwave food to prepare consumables for your next outing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/af8e4632723d617ceecdf78cf131943d.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=1056 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/af8e4632723d617ceecdf78cf131943d.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/af8e4632723d617ceecdf78cf131943d.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/6e183953fde969755e49f46b5c176c09.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=750 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/6e183953fde969755e49f46b5c176c09.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/6e183953fde969755e49f46b5c176c09.mp4?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore at your own pace. But be aware that you are not alone, and resources are scarce. There is no in-game map. Just your memory, your notes, and the human instinct to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A door that opens to places it shouldn't. Research labs, a darkened suburban street, endless tiled pools, and the yellow glow of lights no human was meant to see.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Hollow Complex</strong> is an action filled survival thriller inspired by the Backrooms. Dive into a dark and twisted rendition of internet folklore that actually allows you to fight back. Explore a web of interconnected locations, complete quests for an odd cast of NPCs, and find new equipment/tools to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PICK YOUR DESTINATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/65c39e973a0fa4d3def5b604c6a74c8e.poster.avif?t=1775566745\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087830/extras/65c39e973a0fa4d3def5b604c6a74c8e.webm?t=1775566745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st